<title>HONG KONG: Exceptional boosts Gold Peak interim net.</title>
<headline>Exceptional boosts Gold Peak interim net.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	 44.7    vs  18.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)  9.0     vs  7.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	87.69   vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			  178.09  vs  78.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		   2,046.5 vs  1,666.8</p>
<p>    Company name	     Gold Peak Industries (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		January 27-30</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	 February 12</p>
<p>NOTE - Gold Peak makes and sells batteries, car audio equipment, electronic components and electrical wiring accessories.</p>
<p>Exceptional gain represents gain resulting from private placements of existing shares of subsidiaries.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
